  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "UBI Business School is a Brussels-based international business school ranked #19 in the QS EMBA Rankings 2026 and awarded 5 Stars for Teaching and Online Learning. Validated by Middlesex University London and recognised by EFMD, BGA, and PRME, UBI blends academic rigour with a strong focus on AI, technology management, and sustainability.",
      "The school offers bachelor's, master's, MBA, and DBA programs in English (and some in Spanish), delivered through an innovative proprietary HyFlex model that seamlessly blends on-campus, hybrid, and online participation. Five intake dates per year for the MBA give maximum flexibility to prospective students worldwide.",
      "UBI's curriculum integrates Microsoft certifications and includes international business experiences at institutions such as LSE and Babson College. The school reports #1 career progression outcomes and maintains strong links with the Brussels corporate ecosystem, providing students direct access to EU institutions, multinational headquarters, and NGOs.",
      "The school operates campuses in Brussels, Luxembourg, and Shanghai, with HyFlex delivery enabling truly global participation. Students from over 100 nationalities study at UBI, building a diverse professional network across finance, technology, energy, and e-commerce sectors."
    ],
